          "_key": "s56i",
          "text": " for standard personal injury cases",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b56l",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s56k",
          "text": "Potential long-term consequences of the injury on the child, such as a permanent disability",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b56n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s56m",
          "text": "Although state law gives a child until age 20 (two years from the child’s 18th birthday) to file a personal injury claim in Colorado, acting quickly can protect your rights by preserving key evidence. Don’t wait to consult with a Denver child injury attorney about a potential claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b56p",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s56o",
          "text": "How Hiring a Child Injury Attorney in Denver Can Help",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b56r",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s56q",
          "text": "If you attempt to bring an injury claim against an individual, entity, or institution on behalf of your injured child in Denver, you may get taken advantage of by a powerful adversary or their insurance company.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b56t",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s56s",
          "text": "If you hire a Denver child injury lawyer, however, this enables you to level the playing field. Your lawyer can investigate your child’s accident, search for evidence against one or more parties, and take over the claims-filing process for you to seek maximum results.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
